 "id": "bindingprob",
 "title": "Neural binding problem",
 "statement": {
  "text": "The unity of consciousness and (cognitive) binding problem is the problem of how objects, background, and abstract or emotional features are combined into a single experience. The binding problem refers to the overall encoding of our brain circuits for the combination of decisions, actions, and perception. It is considered a \"problem\" because no complete model exists.",
